    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>Update to 0.1.13

Includes upstream's breaking changes (dataclasses field-resolution split,
unified native enum state, exact-match reflection, TVMFFIAny relayout) and
raises the Python floor to 3.9. The sole reverse dependency python-xgrammar
was rebuilt against 0.1.13 locally on aarch64: clean build, native binding
loads on both python313 and python314.</comment>
